@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule IV (src:3431-3494)
GIVEN weeks IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Act Schedule IV the number of weeks of benefits that would have been paid at a rate of weekly benefits of 55%` IS
